    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS welcome this beautifully presented 2-bedroom ground floor apartment, ideally positioned in the ever-popular Citywest area. This inviting home offers a perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and modern living, making it an excellent choice for a wide range of buyers.\nThe property boasts a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen and living area, thoughtfully designed to maximise both light and functionality. Double doors lead out to an east-facing balcony, the perfect spot to enjoy your morning coffee and soak up the early sunshine.\nThe accommodation comprises of two well-proportioned bedrooms and a main bathroom, with electric heating throughout. The apartment additionally benefits from two car spaces located in a secured underground car park.\nLocation is key, and this property delivers. Situated just minutes from the LUAS, commuting to the city centre is both quick and hassle-free. Citywest Shopping Centre is also within easy reach, along with a wide array of local shops, cafés, and essential amenities right on your doorstep.\nWhether you're a first-time buyer looking to step onto the property ladder, an investor seeking a strong rental opportunity, or a downsizer in search of a low-maintenance home, this apartment ticks all the boxes.\n\nAdditional features:\n• c. 65 sq.m\n• BER D1\n• Management fees- 2328 per annum\n• Ground floor apartment\n• 2 Bed/ 1 Bath\n• Electric heating\n• Open plan kitchen/ living area\n• East facing balcony\n• Ideally located minutes from the LUAS, Citywest Shopping Centre and a variety of local schools, shops and amenities.\n\nDirections:\nFrom the N7, take the exit for Citywest / Saggart (R113). At the roundabout, take the exit onto the R113 heading towards Citywest. Continue straight through the next roundabout and proceed towards the Citywest Shopping Centre. At the following roundabout, take the turn for Carrigmore. Continue straight and follow the road around until you reach Carrigmore Crescent, Saggart."
      },
      {
